  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Garamba Alliance</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The activity will bring together a group of local actors from the private sector, civil society, government, and donors to establish a shared view of development for the region surrounding Garamba National Park. By applying a private-sector approach to interventions across Agriculture, Artisanal Mining, Conservation, Renewable Energy, and Vocational Skills Training, the activity will counter the incentives of local populations to pursue environmentally damaging behaviours.</narrative>
  </description>
